# Sol-Sandbox Build Notes

This file summarizes the public development trail of the prototype.


---


# Sandbox V13.4 — Phase B Stats Patch

Base: Sandbox V13.3 Chart & Timebar Patch.

## Added
- Live Market Stats panel inside Demo.
- Peak MCAP, current MCAP, drawdown and run change.
- Total Volume, Buy Volume, Sell Volume and Net Flow.
- Buy/Sell Ratio based on directional trade volume.
- Wallet Distribution buckets: Players, Bots, Whales, Rivals and Dev.
- Largest Holder, largest share, Top 10 concentration and active holder count.
- Dev PnL and dev position value.
- Holder table with share, value and PnL.
- Flow tab with biggest buy/sell and clearer buy/sell pressure.
- Recent Transactions table now has filters for Player and Large orders, relative time, PnL and a summary strip.
- Backend market_statistics payload now exposes richer stats for later UI/API usage.

## Not included yet
- Phase C bot control expansion.
- Phase D Demo/Premium split and landing selection.
- Final visual polish.


