# Sandbox V13.6 Phase D — Feature Structure Patch

Basis: V13.5 Phase C Bot Engine Patch.

## Scope
- Bot Engine moved into a selectable feature workspace controlled from the left sidebar.
- Added left sidebar feature tabs: Bot Engine, Tax Treasury, Market Settings, Financials.
- Added Tax Treasury panel for dev wallet / treasury readout and treasury-related toggles.
