# Sandbox V13.12 Performance + Live Market Patch

Built on Sandbox_V13_11_3_PreMigration_Sells_Bot_Traders.

## Added
- Auto Market button in the main control row.
- Pause Market state using the same button.
- Tick speed controls: 1x / 2x / 5x.
- Backend per-simulation live market loop.
- WebSocket broadcast after each automatic tick.
- Throttled autosave during auto market mode to reduce DB/file pressure.
- Small immediate Syncing feedback for user actions so short response delays feel less dead.

## Kept intentionally
- Force Tick remains available for debugging/manual learning.
- Existing REST Buy/Sell/Tick flow remains the source of truth.
- Existing WebSocket pipeline remains in use.
- No feature removal.

## Test checklist
1. Start backend and frontend.
2. Open Demo, start or resume a session.
3. Click Auto Market and confirm chart/trades move without page flashes.
4. Change 1x / 2x / 5x and confirm movement speed changes.
5. Pause Market and confirm automatic movement stops.
6. Buy/Sell while Auto Market is on.
7. Refresh page and confirm session still loads.


