# Sandbox V13.13.1 Railway Deploy Fix

Fixes after V13.13.0:
- Added `frontend/railway.json` and `frontend/Dockerfile` so frontend deploy is Node-only.
- Enabled Next.js standalone output for smaller, cleaner Railway runtime.
- Added `backend/railway.json`, `backend/Dockerfile`, and backend-local `requirements.txt` for backend-only root deployments.
- Increased Railway healthcheck timeout to 300 seconds.
- Updated root `railway.json` to explicitly use `backend.Dockerfile` for backend deploys from repo root.
- Added deployment notes explaining correct Railway root directories.


