# Sandbox V13.16.1 — Chart History + Wallet PnL Polish

Built on V13.15.2 Bot Bias + Chart Tools Patch.

## Fixes

- Expanded backend runtime history defaults to 120,000 candles and 60,000 trades.
- Removed frontend normalization caps that silently cut candles/trades.
- WebSocket snapshots now send a much larger history window and frontend snapshots merge history instead of replacing long history with compact live payloads.
- DEX chart no longer compresses post-migration candles into too few bars.
- All chart now acts as a true full-session view and clears stale zoom/range data when selected.
- Updated visible version labels and package/backend versions to 13.16.1.
- Added % PnL directly in the left wallet rail and selected-wallet summary.
- Fixed the large-entry display bug where a fresh large buy could show instantly around -50% because wallet PnL was using the 100% exit quote including self-slippage. Wallet PnL now uses current mark position value; executable 25/50/100% sell quotes remain available separately.

## Notes

The sell quote can still be negative on a full exit in very thin liquidity, which is realistic. The wallet PnL display no longer treats that full-exit slippage as if the entry itself was already down massively.


