# Sandbox V13.16.1 — Dynamic Liquidity + Rooms UX Patch

Focused patch on top of the previous stable build. Goal: keep the current organic chart/market feel, but fix the misleading liquidity behavior and make multiplayer rooms simpler and safer for colleague playtests.

## Dynamic Liquidity / Pool Math
- Raydium-style AMM liquidity display now syncs from actual pool reserves after buys and sells.
- Sell-side dynamic liquidity removes more visible depth from the pool instead of leaving a huge stale liquidity number after MCAP drops.
- Dynamic LP changes resize pool depth at the current price, so the chart shape/market behavior stays organic instead of being broadly reworked.
- Pump.fun/bonding-curve dynamic liquidity can now reduce virtual depth on sells/rugs while preserving the displayed price.
- Bonding Curve stats expose actual liquidity source/diagnostics through the existing metrics path.

## Rooms UX / Safety
- Creating a room now automatically joins the creator.
- Rooms page includes a simple Join by room code input for colleague tests.
- Joining/creating a room marks the next Demo launch as an active room, so Demo opens directly into that shared market instead of showing the session restore prompt again.
- Room list hides stale empty rooms and solo placeholders to keep quick-join clean.
- Room markets use a slightly more volatile default preset for multiplayer play without forcing a separate scripted chart path.
- Player wallet actions can be locked server-side to the current browser/client's own player wallet.
- Demo wallet selector shows only the current player's room wallet while in a room.
- Chart now shows a visible Room Chart badge with the room code.
- Other real players' chart trades use small professional circle/diamond markers without amount or PnL leakage.
- Top Traders / Traders tabs hide other room players' exact PnL, coins and position value.

## Versioning
- Visible app/backend/package labels updated to 13.16.1.


