# Sandbox V13.16.1 — Demo/Dashboard Wallet Sidebar Hotfix

Focused hotfix after live testing V13.16.0 online.

## Fixed

- Wallet sidebar now appears on both `/demo` and `/dashboard`.
- This fixes the case where Premium users enter the simulator through Dashboard and the left wallet panel disappears even though the same DemoDashboard component is running.
- Existing wallet cache protection remains in place, so empty boot snapshots still do not overwrite the last valid wallet list.

## Scope

- No market logic changes.
- No liquidity formula changes.
- No rooms behavior changes.
- This is only a route/UI visibility hotfix for the wallet rail.
